## Development rules

Work in small, reviewable steps.

Do not:
- rewrite the whole app in one pass
- implement real Stripe calls yet
- implement real OpenAI calls yet
- implement real GCP calls yet
- add native mobile
- add Kubernetes
- add GraphQL
- add marketplace functionality

The TypeScript app lives at the repository root. The earlier Django scaffold has
been removed.

